<title>NORWAY: Norway's Oct PPI rose 3.7 pct yr/yr, up 0.6 m/m.</title>
<headline>Norway's Oct PPI rose 3.7 pct yr/yr, up 0.6 m/m.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES     OCT 1996  SEPT 1996  OCT 1995</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	 +0.6	 +1.3	-0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	   +3.7	 +2.8	+2.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	    161.5	160.5     155.7</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
